{
  dimensions: { width: 1-100, depth: 1-100, height: 1-256 },
  materials: { walls: "oak_planks", ... },
  features: ["door", "windows", "roof"]
}

// Blueprint schema constrains operations
{
  palette: ["oak_planks", "glass_pane"], // max 15, allowlist-validated
  steps: [
    { op: "fill|hollow_box|set|line|window_strip|roof_gable|roof_flat", ... }
  ]
}
```

### Building Operations (`src/operations/`)
Seven geometric primitives: `fill`, `hollow_box`, `set`, `line`, `window_strip`, `roof_gable`, `roof_flat`

### LLM Integration (`src/llm/gemini-client.js`)
- Gemini 2.0 Flash with JSON schema mode for structured outputs
- Automatic blueprint repair on validation failures
- Token usage tracking

### Bot Commands (`src/bot/commands.js`)
```
/build <description>  → Execute full pipeline
/build cancel         → Stop current build
/build undo          → Reverse last build (tracked in history)
/build status        → Progress: blocks placed, elapsed time
```

